OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA grey start again, though
OL,6,Fbrighter spells will develop through
OL,7,Fthe morning. A band of rain will move
OL,8,Fnorth during the afternoon, heavy and
OL,9,Fthundery in places.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA wet evening to come with
OL,12,Fsome further heavy rain and
OL,13,Fthunderstorms. Further outbreaks of
OL,14,Frain likely overnight, heaviest
OL,15,Ftowards the coast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FA cloudy day on Friday with
OL,18,Ffurther outbreaks of rain. The rain
OL,19,Fheavy and persistent at times,
OL,20,Fespecially towards the coast.
OL,21,FTemperatures nearer average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
